            { module = "Journal", kind = "Changed", text = "Trophies and Badges are pages of the book laid out as the spellbook's What's Training: a title with your total, then each zone's bosses, rares and elites (or the badges earned and still to earn) two or three across, each with its face or icon, its name and how far along you are. Its filter picks kinds as well as defeated or not." },
            { module = "Journal", kind = "Changed", text = "NPCs show their model (by its ID when its look wasn't read; the look is now read while you talk to it too), when you met them, last saw them and how often you dealt with them, where you found them with the places in each zone, and their wares as slots. Items write what their tooltip says on the page, no tooltip in it." },
